# ResearchPaperAI

> AI-powered research paper analysis platform for semantic search, paper comparison, summarization, and research insights.

[![Next.js](https://img.shields.io/badge/Next.js-15-black?logo=next.js)](https://nextjs.org/)
[![TypeScript](https://img.shields.io/badge/TypeScript-blue?logo=typescript)](https://www.typescriptlang.org/)
[![Tailwind CSS](https://img.shields.io/badge/Tailwind-CSS-38B2AC?logo=tailwind-css)](https://tailwindcss.com/)
[![License](https://img.shields.io/badge/License-MIT-green.svg)](LICENSE)

## Overview

ResearchPaperAI is a web-based research assistant designed to help researchers organize, analyze, search, compare, and understand scientific papers.

## Features

- 📚 Research paper library
- 📄 PDF paper upload
- 🤖 AI-powered paper analysis
- 🔎 Semantic search
- 💬 Ask questions about research papers
- 📊 Paper comparison
- 📝 Paper summarization
- 💡 Research insights
- 📓 Research notes
- 🎨 Modern research dashboard

## Application Modules

### Dashboard

Provides an overview of uploaded papers, indexed content, processing status, and research activity.

### Paper Library

Manage and organize research papers from a centralized interface.

### Ask ResearchPaperAI

Interact with uploaded research papers using natural-language questions.

### Semantic Search

Find relevant passages across the research-paper collection.

### Paper Comparison

Compare research papers side-by-side.

### Research Insights

Identify useful patterns and insights from the indexed research corpus.

## Technology Stack

- Next.js
- React
- TypeScript
- Tailwind CSS
- AI/LLM integration
- Semantic search
- PDF processing

